    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i> \u2013 where the instinct to survive is no longer a choice, but your only reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dead Beyond</i>, you awaken disoriented and imprisoned inside a deranged maze of horrors. A vengeful madman has abducted you, and his thirst for revenge has turned this once-abandoned house into a custom-built nightmare. This isn't just a hideout\u2014it's a twisted, living trap designed to torment and destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies roam the dark corridors, groaning and hungry for flesh. Death lurks around every corner\u2014through cleverly concealed traps, mind-bending puzzles, and sinister surprises that challenge your reflexes and your sanity. Each room has a purpose. Each corridor hides a secret. And every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll have to think fast, act faster, and trust your instincts. There\u2019s no map. No mercy. Just you, your wits, and the overwhelming terror that threatens to consume you. Will you fight your way through, or become one more forgotten victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Beyond</strong> is a <i>First-Person Survival Horror</i> game that blends intense combat, atmospheric storytelling, and spine-chilling jump scares. But this isn\u2019t just another zombie shooter\u2014it\u2019s a psychological gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a house that feels alive, shifting with every level. Each floor presents new challenges, forcing you to adapt. One level might demand pure combat as zombies swarm in droves. Another may trap you in pitch-black corridors with nothing but your senses to guide you. And others may test your mind with intricate platforming or logic puzzles where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-pounding survival horror</strong> with unpredictable zombie encounters and terrifying jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic level design</strong> \u2013 Each section of the house offers unique challenges, traps, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blended gameplay mechanics</strong> \u2013 A mix of survival horror and first-person platforming for a diverse experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven revenge narrative</strong> \u2013 Discover the twisted reason behind your kidnapping and uncover the identity of your tormentor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sound and lighting</strong> \u2013 Every creak, groan, and shadow plays with your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself. This house wasn\u2019t built for comfort.<br> It was built for <i>revenge</i>.<br> Escape is not guaranteed.<br><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i>.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i> \u2013 where the instinct to survive is no longer a choice, but your only reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dead Beyond</i>, you awaken disoriented and imprisoned inside a deranged maze of horrors. A vengeful madman has abducted you, and his thirst for revenge has turned this once-abandoned house into a custom-built nightmare. This isn't just a hideout\u2014it's a twisted, living trap designed to torment and destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies roam the dark corridors, groaning and hungry for flesh. Death lurks around every corner\u2014through cleverly concealed traps, mind-bending puzzles, and sinister surprises that challenge your reflexes and your sanity. Each room has a purpose. Each corridor hides a secret. And every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll have to think fast, act faster, and trust your instincts. There\u2019s no map. No mercy. Just you, your wits, and the overwhelming terror that threatens to consume you. Will you fight your way through, or become one more forgotten victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Beyond</strong> is a <i>First-Person Survival Horror</i> game that blends intense combat, atmospheric storytelling, and spine-chilling jump scares. But this isn\u2019t just another zombie shooter\u2014it\u2019s a psychological gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a house that feels alive, shifting with every level. Each floor presents new challenges, forcing you to adapt. One level might demand pure combat as zombies swarm in droves. Another may trap you in pitch-black corridors with nothing but your senses to guide you. And others may test your mind with intricate platforming or logic puzzles where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-pounding survival horror</strong> with unpredictable zombie encounters and terrifying jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic level design</strong> \u2013 Each section of the house offers unique challenges, traps, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blended gameplay mechanics</strong> \u2013 A mix of survival horror and first-person platforming for a diverse experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven revenge narrative</strong> \u2013 Discover the twisted reason behind your kidnapping and uncover the identity of your tormentor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sound and lighting</strong> \u2013 Every creak, groan, and shadow plays with your mind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself. This house wasn\u2019t built for comfort.<br> It was built for <i>revenge</i>.<br> Escape is not guaranteed.<br><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i>.</strong></p>",
